  bx_ape: {"tier": 0, "zh": "白猿", "en": "White Ape", "bio": {"zh": "斷崖深谷裡的白猿，一身白毛，灰黑的皮臉，雙臂長過膝蓋。守著崖上的朱果，誰伸手就一掌拍下去；認可的人，牠會親手把果子遞過去。", "en": "A white ape of the gorge under the broken cliff: white fur, a dark leathery face, arms longer than its legs. It guards the red fruit on the cliff and swats any hand that reaches for it; to someone it accepts, it hands the fruit over itself."}, "habitat": {"zh": "斷崖下的深谷與瀑布", "en": "The gorge and falls under the broken cliff"}},
  bx_tiger: {"tier": 0, "zh": "吊睛白額虎", "en": "White-Browed Tiger", "bio": {"zh": "額頭一個「王」字、雙眼吊梢的大老虎。白天伏在山崗上曬太陽，黃昏才下山找吃的；一聲吼，整片林子的鳥都飛走了。", "en": "A great tiger with the character for “king” on its brow and slanting eyes. It suns itself on the ridge by day and comes down at dusk to hunt; one roar and every bird in the forest takes flight."}, "habitat": {"zh": "山崗與松林", "en": "Mountain ridges and pine woods"}},
